 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2022 年 8 月，一名用户打开 Curve 的官网。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 8 月，一名用户打开 Curve 的官网。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 1.702,
   "speechEnd": 5.326
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "他输入的域名，一个字母都没错。",
   "spoken": "他输入的域名，一个字母都没错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 5.74,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 5.74,
   "speechEnd": 8.119
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "地址栏旁边，HTTPS 的锁标志也在，浏览器没有任何警告。",
   "spoken": "地址栏旁边，HTTPS 的锁标志也在，浏览器没有任何警告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 8.52,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 8.611,
   "speechEnd": 13.585
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "页面请他授权，他签了名。",
   "spoken": "页面请他授权，他签了名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 14.02,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 14.112,
   "speechEnd": 16.073
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "签完之后，他的代币被转走。",
   "spoken": "签完之后，他的代币被转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 16.48,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 16.48,
   "speechEnd": 18.947
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "这一次，用户合计损失约 57 万美元。",
   "spoken": "这一次，用户合计损失约 57 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 19.34,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 19.438,
   "speechEnd": 24.244
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "Curve 的合约没有任何变化，审计过的代码也没出错，链上的一切都和昨天一样。",
   "spoken": "Curve 的合约没有任何变化，审计过的代码也没出错，链上的一切都和昨天一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 24.68,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 24.68,
   "speechEnd": 29.971
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "变的是页面。",
   "spoken": "变的是页面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 30.42,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 30.518,
   "speechEnd": 31.615
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "那天，这个域名被解析到一个克隆的前端，攻击者没碰合约，他换掉的是页面。",
   "spoken": "那天，这个域名被解析到一个克隆的前端，攻击者没碰合约，他换掉的是页面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 32.0,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 32.0,
   "speechEnd": 39.463
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
